Source: tremorlabs/tremor at commit ca4d588f47820ff3d514d37fa4ee08a4222dec11
(2025-10-10), files src/components/Card/Card.tsx (v1.0.0),
src/components/LineChart/LineChart.tsx (v1.0.0),
src/components/BarChart/BarChart.tsx and src/utils/{chartColors,cx,getYAxisDomain}.ts.

Modifications by Kalos (each file's header lists its own):
- Colours map to the Kalos design tokens (--chart-*, accent, fg-muted)
  instead of Tremor's Tailwind palette names; grid, axis and tooltip styles
  use the Kalos neutrals.
- Ported from recharts 2 to recharts 3 (the version this app ships).
- Radix Slot, @remixicon/react and tailwind-variants are not used; there is
  no new dependency. cx() is the app's cn() (clsx + tailwind-merge).
- Interactive selection (onValueChange), the scrolling legend slider and
  tooltipCallback are removed; the legend is plain HTML above the plot.
- `any` types are replaced with typed props.
